    <source>Melody verified against the Wikipedia LilyPond melody and Trebly's bar-by-bar letter notes with beat lengths (both 6/8, C major, 8 bars); octaves checked against Octotune. See song.json for sources. Left-hand part is a PianoFlow teaching setting.</source>
